# Wanted: A New Introductory Course for Social Science and the Humanities

**Authors:** Kieffer, Jarold A.

## Abstract
As a substitute for what he sees as confusion of separate introductory courses in the different areas, the author proposes an interdisciplinary social science-humanities course organized around basic questions about man's individual and group needs and behaviors, group relationships and processes, value systems, and techniques for creating and transmitting culture. (JT)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ131180

